v3.0
This is the engineering-grade version of the Master PRD: it keeps every product rule and adds a production frontend, database and backend specification you can paste into an AI builder (Google AI Studio, Cursor, Claude Code) one section at a time.
0. Master instruction (paste first)
You are a principal full-stack engineer and product designer building "Mero Job Nepal":
an employment, recruitment, freelance, networking, HR and sponsor-funded rewards platform
for Nepal, designed to expand worldwide.

Build production-grade code, not demos. For every module deliver: database migration,
RLS policies, server functions, typed API client, UI, tests, and seed data.
Never put secrets, ledger logic or authorization decisions in client code.
Work in the order of Section 6 (Build Sequence). After each step, list what is done,
what is stubbed, and what needs legal/partner approval.
Non-negotiable rules (apply to every module):
1.  Money is never a mutable number. Balances are derived from an append-only ledger.
2.  The client never decides rewards, rankings, verification status or permissions.
3.  AI is advisory. No AI output automatically rejects, ranks out or blocks a person.
4.  Self-reported data is never displayed as verified.
5.  Rewards are never tied to job applications, recruiter visibility or candidate ranking.
6.  No AdMob/AdSense inventory in the cash-reward flow; only directly funded sponsor campaigns.
7.  Default to Nepali + English, low-bandwidth, low-end Android (2 GB RAM, 3G).
8.  Data minimisation: collect only what a feature needs; every sensitive field has a purpose and retention rule.
