2.6 Rewards task player (security-sensitive UI)
• The player requests a signed, short-lived task session from the server; it never computes or submits a reward amount.
• Playback progress is reported as periodic heartbeats; the server validates elapsed time against video duration and tolerance.
• The content question is fetched only after the server confirms minimum watch time; answers are verified server-side.
• No auto-click or ad-click rewards. The UI shows sponsor identity and reward before start and the result state (pending review) after finish.
